                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "More than 700,000 New Jerseyans would lose healthcare coverage if this plan moves forward. That's 700,000 seniors, children, people with disabilities, left to fend for themselves. All so the top 1% can get another tax cut. https://t.co/iJVLqbucCK",
