                "quoted_status_profile_username": "wildstein",
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "An informed citizenry is necessary to a strong community and strong democracy. From https://t.co/N5qH0JMPQM laying off its DC reporter, to News12 scaling back its political coverage, to this latest news of the upcoming closure of NJPBS, New Jerseyans are losing the sources of information necessary to make informed decisions about their elected leaders and New Jersey\u2019s future.",
