                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "If ACA subsidies aren't extended...\n\nPremiums will increase 220% in @Congressman_JVD's district\n\n41,000 people in Rep. Chris Smith's district will see their premiums increase.\n\nA 60-year-old couple in @CongressmanKean's district will see their premiums increase by $15,000.\n\nTheir constituents want to see healthcare protected, so why don't they?",
